# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# Docker does NOT read .gitignore. Without this file, the `COPY . /opt/framework`
# in infrastructure/app/Dockerfile bakes every gitignored secret in the repo
# into an image that gets pushed to ECR by .github/workflows/deploy.yml:
# .env, the local SQLite database, and — worst — the Terraform state under
# infrastructure/terraform/environments/prod/, which stores the RDS master
# password, the Airflow Fernet key, the webserver secret key and the Airflow
# admin password in plaintext.
#
# It is also a build-time fix: the context was 7.7 GB (7.4 GB of it the
# per-module .terraform/ provider caches), re-uploaded to the daemon on
# every build.
#
# Both root-context builds share this file — infrastructure/app/Dockerfile
# and infrastructure/airflow/Dockerfile. Anything either of them COPYs must
# stay out of the exclusions below:
#   app     -> pyproject.toml, README.md, src/, alembic/, alembic.ini, scripts/
#   airflow -> case_studies/, infrastructure/airflow/{requirements.txt,dags,entrypoint.sh}

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Secrets and infrastructure state — never in an image.                  #
# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
.env
.env.*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
# The whole Terraform tree: state, tfvars, and the provider caches that
# made up 96% of the build context. Nothing here is needed at runtime.
infrastructure/terraform/
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Version control and CI metadata                                        #
# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.claude/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Virtualenvs, build artifacts, caches                                   #
# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Local databases and logs                                               #
# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Not needed at runtime                                                  #
# --------------------------------------------------------------------- #
tests/
docs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
